    <div class="row">
        <div class="span12">
            <h3 class="headline">
                <span>storeXpathCount (target, pattern) - Selenium IDE command</span>
            </h3>
        </div> 

        <div class="span12">

            <p>
                The  <span class="hired">storeXpathCount</span> command is used to retrieve and store the
                count of the UI elements located
                using the given <a href="/rpa/docs/selenium-ide/locators#xpath">XPath locating strategy</a> into a variable in Selenium IDE.
                In other words, it gets the number of nodes that match the specified xpath (e.g. "//table" would give the number of tables).
            </p>
            
            <h3>storeXpathCount Example</h3>
            <p>
                The macro below counts all links on the page.
            </p>
            

            <p>
                <table class="table table-bordered">
                    <thead>
                    <th class="col-md-2">Command</th>
                    <th class="col-md-5">Target</th>
                    <th class="col-md-5">Pattern/Text</th>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>

                        <tr>
                            <td>open</td>
                            <td>https://ui.vision/docs/selenium-ide/storexpathcount</td>
                            <td></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="success">
                            <td>storeXpathCount</td>
                            <td>xpath=//a</td>
                            <td>c</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>echo</td>
                            <td>Number of Links on Page = ${c}</td>
                            <td></td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </p>

